{%- comment -%}
  Nessclusive — self-hosted variable fonts.

  Bricolage Grotesque (display) and Inter Tight (body), served from the Shopify
  CDN rather than Google Fonts so there is no third-party request in the
  critical path.

  Both are variable fonts, so a single file covers every weight the design uses.
  The italic cut is deliberately not shipped — the prototype uses no italics
  anywhere, and it would add ~240KB. If italics are ever needed the browser
  synthesises them; add InterTight-Italic-VariableFont_wght as woff2 to restore
  the real cut.

  @font-face lives here rather than in a .css asset so the font URLs can go
  through asset_url and pick up Shopify's cache-busting version string.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{
  'ness-inter-tight-var.woff2'
  | asset_url
  | preload_tag: as: 'font', type: 'font/woff2', crossorigin: 'anonymous'
}}
{{
  'ness-bricolage-grotesque-var.woff2'
  | asset_url
  | preload_tag: as: 'font', type: 'font/woff2', crossorigin: 'anonymous'
}}

{% style %}
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Inter Tight';
    src: url({{ 'ness-inter-tight-var.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2-variations');
    font-weight: 100 900;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque';
    src: url({{ 'ness-bricolage-grotesque-var.woff2' | asset_url }}) format('woff2-variations');
    font-weight: 200 800;
    font-stretch: 75% 100%;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }
{% endstyle %}
